#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:2
#: f5267835c2414a03afc7c4e2f65c83c5
msgid "其他"
msgstr "Other"

#: 45f23ad54a364f7da97a8ff8ae72c1aa
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:15
msgid "Ai-WB2系列模组支持哪些开发方式"
msgstr "What development methods are supported by Ai-WB2 series modules?"

#: 7a5d4f1e99734187ad74261513ba0f77
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:16
msgid "AT开发，window环境和liunx环境开发"
msgstr ""
"AT development, development in Windows environment, and development in "
"Linux environment."

#: 3fdb2ef061c144b09d45f8de972dbfd3
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:19
msgid "Ai-WB2-32S模组与ESP32-S模组有什么区别，软硬件能否兼容"
msgstr ""
"What are the differences between the Ai-WB2-32S module and the ESP32-S "
"module? Are the software and hardware compatible?"

#: 3812b47bb75f414383d916a1bd880981
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:20
msgid ""
"Ai-"
"WB2-32模组与ESP32-S模组封装兼容，但是引脚定义不一样；软件上所使用的芯片也不一样，WB2-32S使用的是BL602芯片，ESP32模组使用的是ESP32D0WD芯片"
msgstr ""
"The Ai-WB2-32 module is package-compatible with the ESP32-S module, but "
"the pin definitions are different. In terms of software, the chips used "
"are also different. The WB2-32S uses the BL602 chip, while the ESP32 "
"module uses the ESP32D0WD chip."

#: 5210d7b098dd4cb2af4d477ccc88af5f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:23
msgid "WB2模组支持WAPI协议吗"
msgstr "Does the WB2 module support the WAPI protocol?"

#: 9e23a990344d486e9476f2396ceedacb
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:24
msgid "支持，不过需要通过二次开发实现"
msgstr "Yes, but it needs to be implemented through secondary development."

#: 82c94854be74452f937c5729c36b9eb7
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:27
msgid "WB2系列模组在做干扰规避测试项，表格上因填写什么参数"
msgstr ""
"When performing the interference avoidance test item for WB2 series "
"modules, what parameters should be filled in the table?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:28
#: b4fda5ad44294e3e91a90c0da0fd5728
msgid "选择监测与避让"
msgstr "Select monitoring and avoidance."

#: 75e726e19f064ba9adff731d3ab04d45
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:31
msgid "请问Ai-WB2-12F模组重新烧写固件的时候，EN引脚的电平设置情况如何？"
msgstr ""
"When reflashing firmware for the Ai-WB2-12F module, how should the EN pin"
" level be set?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:32
#: edf20f7620ce4a59b04b34002a1cc91b
msgid "当软件提示 “Please Press Reset Key” 的时候，将EN引脚拉低之后，再拉高"
msgstr ""
"When the software prompts “Please Press Reset Key”, pull the EN pin low, "
"and then pull it high again."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:35
#: d5a8e02890014f5c9583c23e9ffb7713
msgid "请问有没有支持入网阿里云的WiFi、蓝牙双模模组？"
msgstr ""
"Are there any Wi-Fi and Bluetooth dual-mode modules that support "
"connecting to Alibaba Cloud?"

#: 535f115203a243538edd51162f61972c
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:36
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Ai-WB2系列模组均支持的，可通过AT指令入网阿里云 `(操作过程见链接)  "
"<https://blog.csdn.net/Boantong%5F/article/details/112971695?ops_request_misc=%257B%2522request%255Fid%2522%253A%2522167141430716800215099422%2522%252C%2522scm%2522%253A%252220140713.130102334.pc%255Fblog.%2522%257D&request_id=167141430716800215099422&biz_id=0&utm_medium=distribute.pc_search_result"
".none-task-blog-2~blog~first_rank_ecpm_v1~rank_v31_ecpm-1-112971695-null-"
"null.nonecase&utm_term=%E9%98%BF%E9%87%8C&spm=1018.2226.3001.4450>`__ "
"，指令与文档中描述的指令是一样的；"
msgstr ""
"All Ai-WB2 series modules support this. They can connect to Alibaba Cloud"
" through AT commands. `(See the operation process in the link)  "
"<https://blog.csdn.net/Boantong%5F/article/details/112971695?ops_request_misc=%257B%2522request%255Fid%2522%253A%2522167141430716800215099422%2522%252C%2522scm%2522%253A%252220140713.130102334.pc%255Fblog.%2522%257D&request_id=167141430716800215099422&biz_id=0&utm_medium=distribute.pc_search_result"
".none-task-blog-2~blog~first_rank_ecpm_v1~rank_v31_ecpm-1-112971695-null-"
"null.nonecase&utm_term=%E9%98%BF%E9%87%8C&spm=1018.2226.3001.4450>`__ The"
" commands are the same as those described in the document."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:40
#: efed20bf18804aa09720ab13896d9a6b
msgid "请问一下，我这边Ai-WB2-12F模组是否支持lua语言开发？"
msgstr "Does the Ai-WB2-12F module support Lua language development?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:41
#: c280a7614a274b30ad7b38e3620b990d
msgid "Ai-WB2-xx系列模组均不支持lua语言开发，仅8266系列支持；"
msgstr ""
"Ai-WB2-xx series modules do not support Lua language development. Only "
"the 8266 series supports it."

#: 94f6d4d90ec4483c8fc846ddcf8a965b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:44
msgid "请问贵公司是否有rj45以太网网络透传功能的模组？"
msgstr ""
"Does your company have any module with RJ45 Ethernet network transparent "
"transmission function?"

#: 1f8837a4f6934ee895e502589f25f310
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:45
msgid "没有。"
msgstr "No."

#: 87920f51e43f4b37aa5f59bf723c233b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:48
msgid "请问程序存储空间与我申请的flash空间是否会有冲突？"
msgstr "Will the program storage space conflict with the flash space I apply for?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:49
#: fe0d54fec3944b7d8672c3fa868d4001
msgid "不会，空间的分化由分区表决定，编译器中已做了防冲突功能；"
msgstr ""
"No. Space allocation is determined by the partition table, and the "
"compiler already includes an anti-conflict mechanism."

#: 2785376de8e44b3894b03e56ae513345
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:52
msgid "WB2系列模组可以用ESP-IDF开发吗？"
msgstr "Can WB2 series modules be developed using ESP-IDF?"

#: 8d28b2dffd87479b8b7bf1b9018f01cb
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:53
msgid "不可以，芯片方案不同"
msgstr "No. The chip solutions are different."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:56
#: c7e644ed85e743a3ab2b8908f68b11e4
msgid "WB2-07S模组天线是蓝牙的还是WIFI的，还是两个共用天线"
msgstr ""
"Is the antenna of the WB2-07S module for Bluetooth or Wi-Fi, or do they "
"share one antenna?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:57
#: e399a73e921744a08abfc15202c23fc7
msgid "BLE和WIFI共用一条天线，分时复用"
msgstr "BLE and Wi-Fi share one antenna and use time-division multiplexing."

#: 3ab11886e4014ff198f56ee13933e44a
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:60
msgid "请问WB2-32S是否支持arduino开发？"
msgstr "Does the WB2-32S support Arduino development?"

#: 725968a9d92f4bf49cfdd6e91e21efdb
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:61
msgid "不支持"
msgstr "No."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:64
#: db4a6b65dfc3404eb06afeb4094b39d2
msgid "请问WB2模组是用的什么内核？"
msgstr "What core does the WB2 module use?"

#: 36ffabc9499d444c89fa3d77a9e0b118
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:65
msgid "RISC-V"
msgstr "RISC-V."

#: 1f6ab3b9304848b9ad53184a5bc9d49d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:68
msgid "请问WB2模组支持空中升级么？"
msgstr "Does the WB2 module support over-the-air upgrade?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:69
#: d5b4922e036548099a338d75ae5c7213
msgid "支持OTA"
msgstr "Yes, it supports OTA."

#: 4634bdd7902d4653a67ce201844c31aa
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:72
msgid "请问WB2模组有16M闪存的么？"
msgstr "Is there a WB2 module with 16M flash?"

#: 46d9b38307234bf7b0da422173f6e107
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:73
msgid "通用的是2M与4M版本，16M需求的需联系商务定制；"
msgstr ""
"The common versions are 2M and 4M. For 16M requirements, please contact "
"sales for customization."

#: 2a1214859c3645f0a75e085ea1c4c3dc
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:76
msgid "WB2系列模块能传输水下的视频吗"
msgstr "Can WB2 series modules transmit underwater video?"

#: 587e665b6baf490aae7039c7e4d64168
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:77
msgid "不支持，水下会吸收一部分的WIFI信号"
msgstr "No. Underwater environments absorb part of the Wi-Fi signal."

#: 41d31304fe5748ddb179544a7e1f20a1
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:80
msgid "Ai-WB2-32S开发板支持TinyGo吗"
msgstr "Does the Ai-WB2-32S development board support TinyGo?"

#: 48e4b5f17d3b4674b97274167e4aa89f
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:81
msgid "目前不支持Go语言开发"
msgstr "Go language development is not currently supported."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:84
#: fedca17805cf471186f6a7646093bb8c
msgid "WB2模块使用单行模式发送数据遇到0x0A会数据异常，应该怎样处理"
msgstr ""
"When the WB2 module uses single-line mode to send data, data becomes "
"abnormal when encountering 0x0A. How should this be handled?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:85
#: f4a6557ec7314bed9e104f3fa46341e0
msgid "由于单行模式的指令判断0D 0A为结束符，故可以使用另外一条指令AT+SOCKETSEND进行发送"
msgstr ""
"Because the command in single-line mode determines 0D 0A as the "
"terminator, you can use another command, AT+SOCKETSEND, to send the data."

#: 316b736d464f4f0ba4f541b5c26e6c5d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:88
msgid "请问WB2系列模组的SDK编译完成以后的固件是合并的还是分散的呢？"
msgstr ""
"After the SDK compilation of WB2 series modules is completed, is the "
"firmware merged or separated?"

#: 6974540355b2412f87e2851f9086b74e
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:89
msgid "是分散的"
msgstr "It is separated."

#: 601367ffbfb54c768a4cf60cffac4a7d
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:92
msgid "WB2-12F跟BW16引脚兼容吗"
msgstr "Are the pins of WB2-12F and BW16 compatible?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:93
#: a1dd3717e22245458a28053cb2ee5b32
msgid "AT固件的脚位兼容，可以无缝切换使用"
msgstr "The pins of the AT firmware are compatible and can be switched seamlessly."

#: 6ae40a03fdec4e18aab0ee6c1118a653
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:96
msgid "WB2-12F可以直接移植ESP-12F的代码吗"
msgstr "Can ESP-12F code be directly ported to WB2-12F?"

#: 63c66ea5f4814cec8daa2bde9688324b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:97
msgid "不可以直接移植，需要基于WB2的SDK进行修改"
msgstr ""
"No. It cannot be directly ported. It needs to be modified based on the "
"WB2 SDK."

#: 0a20ead8ce1b49b6889912dc22e4d692
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:100
msgid "WB2系列模组支持BLE MESH与其他品牌的BLE MESH可通配使用吗"
msgstr ""
"Can the BLE MESH function of WB2 series modules be used interchangeably "
"with BLE MESH from other brands?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:101
#: c2b1db2354a9444da90bc36ee636b29b
msgid "MESH功能需要做开发实现  AT固件没有该功能"
msgstr ""
"The MESH function needs to be implemented through development. The AT "
"firmware does not have this function."

#: 0da38b7d55f54d94ae78bd368cda72dd
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:104
msgid "WB2-07S的GPIO接口，模块内部有没有上拉电阻"
msgstr ""
"Do the GPIO interfaces of the WB2-07S have internal pull-up resistors "
"inside the module?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:105
#: e8feec0d8d5144f2916e6fb477d97d22
msgid "模组内部的GPIO没有接上拉电阻"
msgstr "The GPIOs inside the module are not connected to pull-up resistors."

#: 594c4ae1ff6945d9847541b2ffbc6337
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:108
msgid "ESP8266二次开发中的eagle.flash文件该如何生成"
msgstr ""
"How is the eagle.flash file generated during secondary development of "
"ESP8266?"

#: 8f421d1ac46b4de0b9f7d843ba98312b
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:109
msgid "在编译规则中，APP选项选择为0，表示不使用OTA功能"
msgstr ""
"In the compilation rules, set the APP option to 0, indicating that OTA is"
" not used."

#: 2af4c56bf8b8454f97b80a1a7137f296
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:112
msgid "8266模块频繁出现wdt reset该如何解决"
msgstr "How to solve frequent wdt reset on the 8266 module?"

#: 55c1379a97fe450baaeadf9a5af8a629
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:113
msgid "检查供电电源，禁止使用USB转TTL串口板进行供电"
msgstr ""
"Check the power supply. Do not use a USB-to-TTL serial board for power "
"supply."

#: 7e2b9371afa44bf5b8290db516e6da65
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:116
msgid "请问有支持NFC配网的WiFi模块么？"
msgstr "Are there any Wi-Fi modules that support NFC provisioning?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:117
#: fbec95bdfc6845269a339e497705e66d
msgid "目前没有；"
msgstr "Not currently."

#: 311e3a47fdfb4e1fb40de5a79b7011b8
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:120
msgid "请问我二次开发固件SPI烧录模式要配置成什么呢？QIO么？"
msgstr ""
"What SPI flashing mode should be configured for secondary development "
"firmware? QIO?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:121
#: d98d10fdd08f4ef691eaec573206fac2
msgid "有二次开发所配置的SPI模式决定；"
msgstr "It is determined by the SPI mode configured for secondary development."

#: 87ade8770dba4405af0063ab1f5882da
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:124
msgid "WB2系列出厂固件支持在线升级吗"
msgstr "Does the factory firmware of the WB2 series support online upgrade?"

#: 2fe75dcafefe4f9cbee0e9622c3ba177
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:125
msgid "支持，可以通过发送OTA指令进行在线升级操作"
msgstr "Yes. Online upgrade can be performed by sending OTA commands."

#: 55a2272c2c0049b4bbc0fb002b925a05
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:128
msgid "请问有WB2系列模组开发的API说明文档么？"
msgstr "Is there an API documentation for WB2 series module development?"

#: 5407466d8bb24f8481516a62c692a758
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:129
msgid "有的，查看 `(查看链接)  <https://wb2-api-web.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`__"
msgstr "Yes. See `(link)  <https://wb2-api-web.readthedocs.io/en/latest/>`__"

#: 3926333cb262490d9d4e0f0d2cfc0cd5
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:132
msgid "请问为何WB2-12S模组发送指令没有任何反应？"
msgstr "Why does the WB2-12S module not respond to commands?"

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:133
#: c14d0eac70004aabb5517daee3a72eda
msgid "若是上电有启动信息，则检查一下RX口是否没接稳，或者接错了。若是没有启动信息，则串口部分有问题，要排查问题。"
msgstr ""
"If there is startup information after power-on, check whether the RX pin "
"is loose or connected incorrectly. If there is no startup information, "
"there is an issue with the serial port part, and troubleshooting is "
"required."

#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:136
#: e4d97df76ef44d609ea6af94c9065f33
msgid "请问模组底部的大焊盘需要接地么？还是悬空？"
msgstr ""
"Should the large pad at the bottom of the module be grounded or left "
"floating?"

#: 910f3e19ec9d495382ec75ad7c8a2ec5
#: ../source/docs/software-framework/WiFi/BL/other.rst:137
msgid "建议直接接地，有助于散热。"
msgstr ""
"It is recommended to connect it directly to ground, which helps with heat"
" dissipation."
